think Wrote pond/apps/mcp_prompt_list.rye: a PromptBook (bounded array of rung one's PromptDesc, add(src) parses into the next slot), render_list → format mcp-prompt-list-v1 (one `prompt <name> <argc>` line), parse_list → entries {name, argc}, verify_list → the honesty proof.
think Honest index for prompts = every listed name truly names a held descriptor whose declared arg_count equals the advertised arity; a disagreeing arity or an absent name → NotHonest. Mirrors resource_list's read-at-published-length, adapted to the template surface (arity, not byte length).
